  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Reestablishment of Connectivity in Priority Grasslands of S. Chihuahuan Desert I</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This project will protect 7,410 acres through a conservation agreement and restore critical habitat for grassland birds such as Spragues Pipit, Lark Bunting and Bairds Sparrow. Partners will also protect and recover soil, promote grass regrowth and restore a drinking trough to benefit Long-billed Curlews and other wildlife.</narrative>
  </description>
